gpui-component-block-editor
===========================

Derived from Bezel (MIT), repository: https://github.com/crabtalk/bezel
Research snapshot: 22c95a643ac6082cf6a65dab578218737f7d1e7b

Loro apply/project loop informed by Catena BlockEditor and Mikra NoteDocument.
Editor chrome from Bezel `editor` crate and gallery patterns.

Ported / vendored sources:
- `crates/editor/src/editor.rs` (surface shape)
- `crates/editor/src/editor/keys.rs`
- `crates/editor/src/editor/input.rs`
- `crates/editor/src/editor/menu.rs` (handle / drop / slash placement)
- `crates/editor/src/editor/image.rs` (URL prompt / image store seam)
- `apps/gallery/src/patterns/editor.rs` (format toolbar below selection)
- `crates/ui/assets/fonts/Geist*.ttf`, `GeistMono.ttf` (SIL OFL; family Geist / Geist Mono)
- `crates/ui/assets/icons/copy.svg`, `check.svg` (Solar)

Glass popovers use Bezel frost/radius recipes. Rounded backdrop blur is not
available on the current mwatts/zed gpui pin; solid frost overlay is used
instead (documented Task 4 gap).
